            "round_number": 1,
            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-09-11T08:10:45.704747+00:00",
            "notes": "Kiriko's clone is incredibly powerful especially early round, so while you could choose to go her double suzu perk(would mostly only consider this if the enemy team had an ana+jq), the clone allows you to take your focus off of healing and really go for the enemy team's throats. Don't be afraid, just keep your tp up and you should be fine to cause murder and mayhem. \n\nI've seen people focus on getting hp related survival purchases in an effort to increase her clone's health. Personally, I do not think the minimal increase in clone health is worth the potential armor, but it is an option. \n\nThis round, just keep shooting whoever your tank is shooting.",
