            "notes": "Play exactly like you did the first round, focusing on racking up cash and trying to assist your tank with kills whenever possible. I love playing really aggro and keeping my tp up to use selfishly, but make sure your fellow support understands this and won't try to either \n\na. heroically try and save you from imminent peril only to be left alone as you tp out or\n\nb. leave you to healbot while they go off angle and not pay attention to the rest of the team",
