            "created_at": "2025-09-11T08:10:45.704747+00:00",
            "notes": "This is where the build can start to go in two directions- either weapon power based or utility based. I highly suggest committing to one and not trying to spread your cash between them equally, it just results in being weak all around, especially this early in the game. \n\n**Weapon Power**\nGo wpn pwr based if your teammates are NOT taking a lot of immediate damage (IE enemy soldier going all in on the helix rocket, ashe going her dynamite build, etc) and you can focus on sustained heals while also assisting with kills. I'd also recommend going this if your second support is focusing really hard on healbotting, as they can  make up for any healing ability you sacrifice.   \n\n**Utility**\nDonut delivery is incredibly strong this season as it has been buffed, and giving your teammate overhealth allows you to take your focus off of them and assist them with whoever they are killing.",
